#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:5
#: b22735192d154aee8c89e88dd704ff93
msgid "Wiki Editing Style Guide"
msgstr "Wiki 编辑风格指南"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:7
#: ef5e615ae3ee48c2b05c113d9f3b52c2
msgid ""
"This page explains some specific parts of syntax used by the wiki along with"
" general style guidelines to promote consistency of appearance and "
"maintainability of wiki content. The general rule is to keep things simple, "
"using as little styling as possible"
msgstr "本页面介绍 wiki 使用的特定语法，以及促进外观一致性和 wiki 内容可维护性的通用风格指南。总原则是保持简洁，尽量少用样式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:9
#: 4f2b5161fc3f4151b94687e607653e77
msgid ""
"For more information check out the `Sphinx reStructured Text Primer "
"<http://www.sphinx-doc.org/en/stable/rest.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"更多信息请参阅 `Sphinx reStructured Text 入门 <http://www.sphinx-"
"doc.org/en/stable/rest.html>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:13
#: 995dd780e508431790abc7bfa2b17a87
msgid "Creating a new page"
msgstr "创建新页面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:17
#: d6a17ed88ade40e9ad1ad73ce0f4389c
msgid ""
"First search the wiki to determine if there is already a wiki page about "
"your topic — it is better to improve an existing topic than create a near-"
"duplicate! Also discuss it with the `Wiki Editors on Discord "
"<https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ or enter an issue in the `Wiki issue list"
" <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/issues>`__."
msgstr ""
"首先搜索 wiki 确认是否已有关于您主题的页面——完善现有主题比创建近似重复内容更好！也可在 `Discord 的 Wiki 编辑频道 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ 讨论，或在 `Wiki issue 列表 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/issues>`__ 提交 issue。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:23
#: afeeb1a786934166acf0afa8d94fc555
msgid ""
"Pages should be created in the **/source/docs/** folder for your target "
"wiki, given a \"descriptive\" name, and the file suffix \".rst\". Typically "
"we use all lower case for filename, and separate words using \"-\" or \"_\"."
" For example: **advanced-multicopter-design.rst**."
msgstr ""
"页面应在目标 wiki 的 **/source/docs/** "
"文件夹中创建，使用「描述性」名称，文件后缀为「.rst」。通常文件名全小写，单词之间用「-」或「_」分隔。例如：**advanced-"
"multicopter-design.rst**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:27
#: a5deaec239d545dfa08299e98ccd8394
msgid ""
"Pages that are common to all wikis must be named with the prefix **common-**"
" and must be created in **/common/source/docs/**. See "
":ref:`common_wiki_editing_guide_common_pages` for more information."
msgstr ""
"所有 wiki 通用的页面必须以 **common-** 为前缀，并必须在 **/common/source/docs/** 中创建。更多信息参见 "
":ref:`common_wiki_editing_guide_common_pages`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:30
#: 61cdf1aef6f84b499ab005dd6399f8f8
msgid ""
"The title of the new page should be concise — informative enough that the "
"reader can determine whether the topic is relevant and to differentiate it "
"from other similar topics. The first letter of every word in the heading "
"should be capitalized, with the exception of short connecting words like "
"\"a\", \"with\", \"and\", \"the\"."
msgstr ""
"新页面的标题应简洁——信息量足以让读者判断主题是否相关，并与其他类似主题区分。标题中每个单词的首字母应大写，但「a」、「with」、「and」、「the」等短连接词除外。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:35
#: 45ee10af71414317a2aae9eb7807bf39
msgid ""
"The title should also be preceded by an anchor link named for the page. So "
"the first information on the page would be:"
msgstr "标题前还应有以页面命名的锚点链接。因此页面的第一条信息应为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:48
#: e0077496fea5474d936bd7f2f8e72fe0
msgid "Working with common pages"
msgstr "处理通用页面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:50
#: 7f6fd23a08a44643810415fee1a55351
msgid ""
"The wiki has a lot of information that is applicable to users of all the "
"different vehicle types. In order to reduce (manual) duplication we define "
"these topics in one place (**/common/source/docs**) and automatically copy "
"them to other wikis where they are needed."
msgstr ""
"wiki "
"有大量适用于所有飞行器类型用户的信息。为减少（手动）重复，我们在一处（**/common/source/docs**）定义这些主题，并自动将其复制到需要的其他"
" wiki。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:55
#: 274faf1bed044018aceb34f8dbf4eca9
msgid ""
"Creating and editing common pages is similar to editing other pages except:"
msgstr "创建和编辑通用页面与编辑其他页面类似，但有以下区别："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:57
#: a98cbd5b7c2e4d9084059683a500a26e
msgid ""
"The filename of common pages must start with the text *common-*. For "
"example, this page is **common-wiki_editing_guide.rst**."
msgstr "通用页面的文件名必须以 *common-* 开头。例如，本页面为 **common-wiki_editing_guide.rst**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:59
#: bc1754d2e41347bdb52b071d46b0fbff
msgid "All common pages must be stored in **/common/source/docs**"
msgstr "所有通用页面必须存储在 **/common/source/docs**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:60
#: cedecfe4c2ab45bab9347daac3d3c2b4
msgid ""
"The copywiki shortcode can be put at the end of the source to specify the "
"set of destination wikis (use \"copywiki\" rather than \"xcopywiki\" below):"
msgstr ""
"copywiki shortcode 可放在源文件末尾，用于指定目标 wiki 集合（使用「copywiki」而非下文的「xcopywiki」）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:67
#: 85ed075b6b32419a8b1d141d58fb0241
msgid ""
"If no copywiki shortcode is specified, common pages are automatically copied"
" to the copter, plane, rover, and sub wikis"
msgstr "如未指定 copywiki shortcode，通用页面将自动复制到 copter、plane、rover 和 sub wiki"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:70
#: d410286f6e7540baa983b30f648bab57
msgid ""
"Vehicle-specific content can be added to the common topic using the ``site``"
" shortcode. Text that is not applicable to a target wiki is stripped out "
"before the common page is copied to each wiki. The example below shows text "
"that will only appear on rover and plane wikis (use site rather than xsite "
"shown below!)"
msgstr ""
"可使用 ``site`` shortcode 向通用主题添加特定飞行器的内容。不适用于目标 wiki 的文本在复制到各 wiki "
"前会被删除。以下示例显示仅出现在 rover 和 plane wiki 的文本（使用 site 而非下面显示的 xsite！）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:79
#: 86de4a74353d4ca6a9356e105e149272
msgid ""
"Always :ref:`link to other common topics <common-editor-information-"
"resource_how_to_link_to_other_topics>` using relative linking. This ensures "
"that you will link to the correct common topic when the wiki article is "
"copied."
msgstr ""
"始终使用相对链接 :ref:`链接到其他通用主题 <common-editor-information-"
"resource_how_to_link_to_other_topics>`。这确保 wiki 文章被复制时链接到正确的通用主题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:82
#: 37132e148c904fc1ad9ca7792fd1d969
msgid "Titles"
msgstr "标题"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:84
#: 6f23e4176756498884d3c6e23aded48e
msgid ""
"Choose a concise and specific title. It should be informative enough that a "
"reader can determine if the content is likely to be relevant and yet "
"differentiate it from other (similar) topics."
msgstr "选择简洁且具体的标题。它应足够信息丰富，使读者能判断内容是否相关，同时与其他（类似）主题区分。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:87
#: e9a87afc3d2f46f687f3418479894eb4
msgid ""
"Use first-letter capitalization for all words in the title (except "
"connecting words: \"and\",\"the\", \"with\" etc.)"
msgstr "标题中所有单词首字母大写（连接词「and」、「the」、「with」等除外）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:89
#: 51830d7f572d4b70a60a7dd2286992af
msgid ""
"The title syntax is as shown below. Note that we use an \"anchor reference\""
" immediately before the title (and named using the page filename). This "
"allows us to link to the file from other wikis and from documents even if "
"they move within the file structure."
msgstr ""
"标题语法如下所示。注意标题前紧跟「锚点引用」（以页面文件名命名）。这使我们即使在文件结构中移动文件，也能从其他 wiki 和文档中链接到该文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:103
#: 7fdf858323d54344baed05b851d5bbfc
msgid "Abstract"
msgstr "摘要"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:105
#: 7a1b03798f4847cbb71e570703abedc7
msgid ""
"Start the topic (after the title) with an abstract rather than a heading or "
"an image."
msgstr "在主题（标题之后）开头写摘要，而非标题或图片。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:107
#: 6e5250f3c3cc4407a34b8f2827496cfe
msgid ""
"Ideally this should be a single sentence or short paragraph describing the "
"content and scope of the topic."
msgstr "理想情况下，这应是描述主题内容和范围的一句话或简短段落。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:111
#: 1117dfab0a254b41a42d60f3263aa9d1
msgid "Headings"
msgstr "标题层级"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:113
#: 0384f194b6b94900993dbdbea38a5a45
msgid ""
"Headings are created by (fully) underlining the heading text with a single "
"character. We use the following levels:"
msgstr "标题通过用单个字符（完整）下划线标题文本来创建。我们使用以下层级："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:136
#: e04c0a44292943fbbacd601903f3c822
msgid "Emphasis"
msgstr "强调"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:138
#: 15f200630bfc49978f34651856496136
msgid ""
"Emphasis should be used *sparingly*. A page with too much bold or italic is "
"hard to read, and the effect of emphasis as a tool for identifying important"
" information is reduced."
msgstr "强调应*谨慎*使用。过多粗体或斜体的页面难以阅读，强调作为标识重要信息工具的效果也会降低。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:142
#: 224a6de2d4ff40fbb35aa9787081adf8
msgid "Use emphasis to mark up *types* of information:"
msgstr "使用强调标记*类型*信息："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:144
#: 4ab5ee782f804aeaaaae4f39ea2c3f3c
msgid "``code`` for code and variables"
msgstr "``代码`` 用于代码和变量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:145
#: 793df2e0067240bb9059792d15ec18fd
msgid "**bold** for \"button to press\" and filenames"
msgstr "**粗体** 用于「要按的按钮」和文件名"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:146
#: 6102e2a6235c43fa81c5fa3d9a16a1ac
msgid "*italic* for names of dialogs and tools."
msgstr "*斜体* 用于对话框和工具名称。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:148
#: ef1c076281e84804ad5a9b854bd2a99d
msgid "The markup for each case is listed below."
msgstr "每种情况的标记如下所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:157
#: f9edbbe9fe094fe298d08e6c6ed3d2ec
msgid "Lists"
msgstr "列表"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:159
#: 1281976036f24f4e9859bb73c2622e39
msgid ""
"Numbered lists can be generated by starting a line with ``#.`` followed by a"
" space. Unordered lists can be generated by starting a line with \"*\" or "
"\"-\". Nested lists are created using further indentation:"
msgstr "有序列表可通过在行首加 ``#.`` 再跟空格来生成。无序列表可通过在行首加「*」或「-」来生成。嵌套列表通过进一步缩进创建："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:184
#: 412f4db6612f41979b9f2cd8698e4d5c
msgid "Information notes and warnings"
msgstr "信息提示和警告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:186
#: 3c1f1379b885426b81b92a5acb09e7b8
msgid ""
"You can add notes, tips and warnings in the text using the \"tip\", \"note\""
" and \"warning\" shortcodes, respectively. These render the text in an "
"information box:"
msgstr "可使用「tip」、「note」和「warning」shortcode 在文本中添加提示、注意和警告，分别以信息框形式渲染文本："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:198
#: 8a9693d439d34f389aba165593916e22
msgid "This is a note"
msgstr "这是一条注意"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:211
#: 7407d40a4511463f8a6e27d1e9f159d0
msgid "This is a tip"
msgstr "这是一条提示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:222
#: 67d9168189a24c02be632361d9558ffd
msgid "This is a warning"
msgstr "这是一条警告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:226
#: 0c1544b2c2f7443089e276276149dc8b
msgid "Code"
msgstr "代码"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:228
#: d9204c85713541d3b10cb7bbc74c6bda
msgid ""
"Use the \"code-block\" directive to declare code blocks. You can specify the"
" type of code too and it will be syntax marked:"
msgstr "使用「code-block」指令声明代码块。也可以指定代码类型，代码将被语法高亮："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:239
#: 5b3c1838b35f4a04aae262ae0791f868
msgid ""
"Alternatively you can just have a double colon \"::\" at the end of a line, "
"a blank line, and then indent the code block text:"
msgstr "或者，在行末加双冒号「::」，空一行，然后缩进代码块文本："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:253
#: 93c51119d8914d9daa3687d866192be7
msgid "Internal links"
msgstr "内部链接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:255
#: 0a7d3239774246b3bf565b1b822ba6f6
msgid ""
"The best way to link to a topic within the docset is to use a reference link"
" to a named anchor. This link will take you to the topic even if the "
"document moves, and you can link to it across wikis."
msgstr "链接到文档集内主题的最佳方式是使用命名锚点的引用链接。即使文档移动，该链接仍可引导到主题，且可跨 wiki 链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:258
#: df8623b6c0f04d33a74fa074069cac28
msgid ""
"An anchor should ideally be placed before a heading (or title) and has the "
"format shown below (the leading underscore and trailing colon are "
"important):"
msgstr "锚点最好放在标题（或大标题）之前，格式如下（前置下划线和结尾冒号很重要）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:267
#: 7a235f7515414515ab3793275c4f6ba1
msgid ""
"We recommend placing an anchor at the top of every page, named using the "
"article filename."
msgstr "建议在每个页面顶部放置一个锚点，以文章文件名命名。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:268
#: cd9d7942a2b24e64bddd408a64604621
msgid ""
"Anchors need to be unique, so use the page anchor as a prefix for heading "
"anchors"
msgstr "锚点需唯一，因此使用页面锚点作为标题锚点的前缀"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:269
#: 99a39156fa01441cb20a05a099817ac2
msgid ""
"We've created a bunch of useful anchors for you; for example, to link to a "
"parameter, you just specify that parameter as the target."
msgstr "我们为您预先创建了一批有用的锚点；例如，链接到某个参数时，只需将该参数指定为目标。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:273
#: 90adfafbca2147209c03c8bda5201ed3
msgid ""
"You can link to the anchor from the same wiki using either of the two "
"approaches below:"
msgstr "在同一 wiki 中可通过以下两种方式之一链接到该锚点："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:280
#: d7251e892221403dade51b1deed22ede
msgid ""
"You can link to the anchor from another wiki by specifying the wiki as a "
"prefix. So for example to link to this anchor defined other wikis you would "
"do:"
msgstr "从其他 wiki 链接到该锚点时，需在前面指定 wiki 名称作为前缀。例如，要链接到其他 wiki 中定义的此锚点，应这样写："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:290
#: 738ebcc83f0a4b9dace6dba3be28919d
msgid ""
"For links within a wiki and in most common topics you can use the \"bare\" "
"format. Sometimes you will need to explicitly specify a target wiki."
msgstr "在同一 wiki 内部链接以及大多数通用主题中，可使用「裸」格式。有时需要明确指定目标 wiki。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:295
#: 0cef547c28db4a1b9b358d8c6b8e35a9
msgid "External links"
msgstr "外部链接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:297
#: 773bf13545694bbf8b96652447254f66
msgid "To link to off-wiki topics, use the following format:"
msgstr "链接到 wiki 外部主题，使用以下格式："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:303
#: 76400958ebc840d78ab273314ac92f64
msgid ""
"This same format can be used for internal links, but without the benefit of "
"being able to track when internal links are broken by title changes etc."
msgstr "此相同格式也可用于内部链接，但无法在标题变更等情况下追踪内部链接断裂的好处。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:308
#: d10d9c84120544fa8a5ec204b160a709
msgid "How to put the page into the sidebar menu"
msgstr "如何将页面添加到侧边栏菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:310
#: b44d57e8f8294bd38587182c4cde7a3b
msgid ""
"Items are added to the sidebar by specifying them in the parent article's "
"\"toctree\" directive. The filename may omit the file extension, but must "
"include the path relative to the current directory (typically there is no "
"path in our wikis)."
msgstr ""
"通过在父文章的「toctree」指令中指定来将条目添加到侧边栏。文件名可省略扩展名，但必须包含相对于当前目录的路径（我们的 wiki 中通常没有路径）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:322
#: 46cce9085545428fb91d8b651969468f
msgid ""
"Sometimes the parent article is \"common\" but the wiki article is specific "
"to a particular wiki. In this case you can wrap the toctree changes using "
"the **site** shortcode (as below, but with \"site\" instead of \"xsite\"). "
"You might also ignore this case, but it will give a \"missing article\" "
"warning."
msgstr ""
"有时父文章是「common」，但 wiki 文章特定于某个 wiki。此时可使用 **site** shortcode 包裹 toctree "
"变更（如下，用「site」而非「xsite」）。也可忽略此情况，但会收到「缺少文章」警告。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:339
#: ff76403d2a014729a8685e7debb7b584
msgid "How to put links in the top menu"
msgstr "如何在顶部菜单中添加链接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:341
#: 129fa7f2ac8c4b85b89312093625115c
msgid ""
"Top menu links are hard coded in the `site theme "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/sphinx_rtd_theme>`__."
msgstr ""
"顶部菜单链接在 `网站主题 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/sphinx_rtd_theme>`__ 中硬编码。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:345
#: f962ec25c97a43d2bd739899d42b8077
msgid "Using images in your wiki pages"
msgstr "在 wiki 页面中使用图片"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:347
#: 74f60e96874c42bfb3e3eb1bd5756e3e
msgid "Our general advice for images is:"
msgstr "我们对图片的一般建议是："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:349
#: bcffb3ecc1b0480097707974431148b2
msgid "Keep images as small as possible."
msgstr "尽量减小图片体积。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:353
#: 4211b249159a4fe295eee7de641d0e56
msgid ""
"Images are stored on Github, so we need to keep the overall size low. Crop "
"images to the relevant information and reduce image quality where possible."
msgstr "图片存储在 GitHub 上，因此需控制总体积。裁剪图片到相关信息区域，并在可能的情况下降低图片质量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:356
#: 3280f549f4fd4948a27bc25950e7d5a2
msgid ""
"Images in common pages or useful across wikis should be in the root "
"**/images** directory."
msgstr "通用页面或跨 wiki 有用的图片应放在根目录的 **/images** 文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:357
#: c835b46421754c69af83b0e9733b473b
msgid ""
"Images specific to the wiki can be stored in its **/images** sub directory."
msgstr "特定 wiki 的图片可存储在其 **/images** 子目录中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:359
#: 106d2b4f41e14f75b186dc24f26e7c83
msgid "Use captions (\"figure directive\") where possible"
msgstr "尽可能使用图注（「figure 指令」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:360
#: 4f6574843e6f44a9b96c9deea51aa338
msgid "Link to the image if it is larger than can be displayed on the page."
msgstr "如果图片大于页面显示尺寸，应链接到原图。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:361
#: b7189996a8074549b5b61cc618fb77d4
msgid "Name the file using all lower case, and underscores between words."
msgstr "文件名全小写，单词之间用下划线分隔。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:362
#: f633481659774b9b93164fe04b6ccbac
msgid ""
"Name the file \"descriptively\" so it is easy to find, and possibly re-use. "
"A name like **planner2_flight_screen.jpg** is much more useful than "
"**image1.jpg**."
msgstr ""
"文件名应具有「描述性」以便查找和重用。**planner2_flight_screen.jpg** 这样的名称远比 **image1.jpg** 有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:364
#: f98af51cd7184dc3af6ee25b0088df54
msgid ""
"To change an image, simply replace the file in the source tree and commit "
"the change."
msgstr "更换图片时，只需替换源代码树中的文件并提交变更。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:366
#: 496cfa3430984d4d874ee79c059262ca
msgid ""
"Display an image in a \"common\" article with a caption and target as shown "
"below. Note the paths to the files are relative to the current directory "
"(hence the relative link back to **images** in the project root)."
msgstr "在「common」文章中显示带图注和目标的图片如下所示。注意文件路径相对于当前目录（因此相对链接回到项目根目录的 **images**）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:377
#: 3578e3bc51fc481c883435941158a88f
msgid ""
"Display a wiki-specific image without a caption (or target link) as shown "
"below. Note that the path is absolute, and relative to the source directory "
"for the wiki."
msgstr "显示不带图注（或目标链接）的特定 wiki 图片如下所示。注意路径是绝对路径，相对于 wiki 的源目录。"
